    "name": "Deck of Stabs",
    "steam_appid": 3658250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/a16e0fd4b16bb4ed3132ed2ef441743d.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=696 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/a16e0fd4b16bb4ed3132ed2ef441743d.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/a16e0fd4b16bb4ed3132ed2ef441743d.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck of Stabs</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where <i>every single card is a weapon</i>. No shields, no spells\u2014just pure stabs! Build a deck of nothing but brutal, beautiful, pixel-art weaponry and unleash it on everything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/c79759f04711e5592358aff7a548f576.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/c79759f04711e5592358aff7a548f576.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/c79759f04711e5592358aff7a548f576.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>five unique stab-happy heroes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steelhand</strong> \u2013 A battle-hardened warrior who crushes enemies with swipes and stuns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bladedancer</strong> \u2013 A flurry of fast, cheap attacks with razor-sharp precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexrazor</strong> \u2013 A twisted sorcerer who curses foes and stabs corpses to fuel unholy power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runecutter</strong> \u2013 A barrage of ancient shards that unleash explosive magical power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zerker</strong> \u2013 A bloodthirsty little rage-a-holic who gets stronger with every kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/4da9bdc8e80cc6c77b623d9b7278086d.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/4da9bdc8e80cc6c77b623d9b7278086d.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/4da9bdc8e80cc6c77b623d9b7278086d.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you\u2019ll build a personalized deck of weapon cards, creating powerful combos that evolve with each run. <strong>Level up</strong> to gain unique passive skills and character perks. <strong>Find items and treasures</strong> that grant special buffs, unlock synergies, and stack into devastating chains of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/cdc2f75f7a49a5179801dfef6089c167.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=752 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/cdc2f75f7a49a5179801dfef6089c167.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/cdc2f75f7a49a5179801dfef6089c167.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its charming pixel art, fast-paced combat, and offsense-focused mechanics, <i>Deck of Stabs</i> offers a fresh twist on the roguelike deckbuilder genre. Every run is a new opportunity to sharpen your deck, stab smarter, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014become the ultimate stabber.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/a16e0fd4b16bb4ed3132ed2ef441743d.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=696 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/a16e0fd4b16bb4ed3132ed2ef441743d.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/a16e0fd4b16bb4ed3132ed2ef441743d.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck of Stabs</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where <i>every single card is a weapon</i>. No shields, no spells\u2014just pure stabs! Build a deck of nothing but brutal, beautiful, pixel-art weaponry and unleash it on everything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/c79759f04711e5592358aff7a548f576.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/c79759f04711e5592358aff7a548f576.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/c79759f04711e5592358aff7a548f576.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>five unique stab-happy heroes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steelhand</strong> \u2013 A battle-hardened warrior who crushes enemies with swipes and stuns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bladedancer</strong> \u2013 A flurry of fast, cheap attacks with razor-sharp precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexrazor</strong> \u2013 A twisted sorcerer who curses foes and stabs corpses to fuel unholy power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runecutter</strong> \u2013 A barrage of ancient shards that unleash explosive magical power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zerker</strong> \u2013 A bloodthirsty little rage-a-holic who gets stronger with every kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/4da9bdc8e80cc6c77b623d9b7278086d.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/4da9bdc8e80cc6c77b623d9b7278086d.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/4da9bdc8e80cc6c77b623d9b7278086d.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you\u2019ll build a personalized deck of weapon cards, creating powerful combos that evolve with each run. <strong>Level up</strong> to gain unique passive skills and character perks. <strong>Find items and treasures</strong> that grant special buffs, unlock synergies, and stack into devastating chains of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/cdc2f75f7a49a5179801dfef6089c167.poster.avif?t=1749563911\" width=752 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/cdc2f75f7a49a5179801dfef6089c167.webm?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/cdc2f75f7a49a5179801dfef6089c167.mp4?t=1749563911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its charming pixel art, fast-paced combat, and offsense-focused mechanics, <i>Deck of Stabs</i> offers a fresh twist on the roguelike deckbuilder genre. Every run is a new opportunity to sharpen your deck, stab smarter, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014become the ultimate stabber.</p>",
    "short_description": "Every card is a weapon. Every decision matters. Battle through strange worlds and dangerous dungeons. Discover exotic weapons, powerful gear, and deadly skills. Burn, curse, explode, and smash your way to victory. Every run is different\u2014just bring your best blades.",
